# Panels made ahead (latency.md step 5): nothing shows and nothing swallows
# clicks before they're opened; their first open is as quick as the next.
# Run right after the shell starts (a fresh desktop).
look material
wait 6
shot after-start-nothing-new
note after-start-nothing-new: only the desktop, menu bar, dock (no panel, no veil)
# a click in the middle of the screen reaches the desktop: right-click the wallpaper
ptr move 960 600 sleep 100 click
wait 1
shot desktop-left-click
ptr move 960 600
setup sleep 0.2
key -k Escape
note a full-screen panel made ahead must not take this click: no panel opens, a desktop hover/selection shows as in the QML
# first opens (cold) and second (warm)
rec cc-first 1.6 key -M alt -k c -m alt
rec cc-first-close 1.4 key -M alt -k c -m alt
rec cc-second 1.6 key -M alt -k c -m alt
rec cc-second-close 1.4 key -M alt -k c -m alt
rec spotlight-first 1.6 key -M alt -k space -m alt
rec spotlight-first-close 1.4 key -k Escape
rec spotlight-second 1.6 key -M alt -k space -m alt
rec spotlight-second-close 1.4 key -k Escape
rec nc-first 1.6 key -M alt -k n -m alt
rec nc-first-close 1.4 ipc panels close
rec nc-second 1.6 key -M alt -k n -m alt
rec nc-second-close 1.4 ipc panels close
rec overview-first 1.6 key -M alt -k Tab -m alt
rec overview-first-close 1.4 key -k Escape
rec overview-second 1.6 key -M alt -k Tab -m alt
rec overview-second-close 1.4 key -k Escape
rec mc-first 1.6 key -M alt -M shift -k Tab -m shift -m alt
rec mc-first-close 1.4 key -k Escape
rec mc-second 1.6 key -M alt -M shift -k Tab -m shift -m alt
rec mc-second-close 1.4 key -k Escape
rec session-first 1.6 key -M ctrl -M alt -k Delete -m alt -m ctrl
rec session-first-close 1.4 key -k Escape
note each *-first start ≤ its *-second start + 17 ms (Rust); with TESSERA_PERF the log has one `debug: prewarm <part>` line per part, none over 50 ms
